<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Training, Sparsity, and Compute Setup</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Optimization and schedule.</span> Adam with learning rate <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3{\times}10^{-4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3{\times}10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math>; LR warmup <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1000" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1000</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1000</annotation></semantics></math> steps; sparsity warmup <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5000" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>5000</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5000</annotation></semantics></math> steps; LR decay starting at <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="80\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">80\%</annotation></semantics></math> of total steps. Precision: <span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">bfloat16</span>. LM batch size <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=4</annotation></semantics></math>, context length <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=2048" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mn>2048</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=2048</annotation></semantics></math>, SAE batch size <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=2048" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mn>2048</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=2048</annotation></semantics></math>. Each run trains on <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sim 5{\times}10^{8}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sim 5{\times}10^{8}</annotation></semantics></math> tokens.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sparsity controls.</span> We sweep six target activity levels</p>
<table id="A1.Ex4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L_{0}\approx\{50,\,80,\,160,\,320,\,520,\,820\}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>,</mo><mn> 80</mn><mo>,</mo><mn> 160</mn><mo>,</mo><mn> 320</mn><mo>,</mo><mn> 520</mn><mo>,</mo><mn> 820</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L_{0}\approx\{50,\,80,\,160,\,320,\,520,\,820\}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p2.2" class="ltx_p">For TopK/BatchTopK we set <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> equal to the chosen <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L_{0}</annotation></semantics></math> (aux-<math id="A1.SS2.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> coefficient <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1/32" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1/32</annotation></semantics></math>; moving-threshold momentum <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.999" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.999</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.999</annotation></semantics></math>; threshold tracking begins at step <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1000" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1000</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1000</annotation></semantics></math>). JumpReLU uses the same set via <span id="A1.SS2.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">target_l0</span>. For <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L_{1}</annotation></semantics></math>–penalized families, we search the following penalty grids:</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A1.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A1.SS2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.SS2.p3.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.6pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A1.SS2.p3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS2.p3.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.SS2.p3.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Family</span></span>
</span></th>
<th id="A1.SS2.p3.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.6pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A1.SS2.p3.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS2.p3.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.SS2.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L_{1}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.SS2.p3.1.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> penalty values (used to span sparsity levels)</span></span>
</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A1.SS2.p3.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS2.p3.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.6pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A1.SS2.p3.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS2.p3.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Standard / Standard-New</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS2.p3.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.6pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A1.SS2.p3.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS2.p3.1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">0.012,  0.015,  0.020,  0.030,  0.040,  0.060</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.SS2.p3.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.SS2.p3.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding:0.6pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A1.SS2.p3.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS2.p3.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Gated SAE</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.SS2.p3.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding:0.6pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A1.SS2.p3.1.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS2.p3.1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">0.012,  0.018,  0.024,  0.040,  0.060,  0.080</span>
</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Training details.</span> All training uses two NVIDIA RTX A800 GPUs. The table below reports the aggregated artifacts and training time (hours) for <em id="A1.SS2.p4.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">30 SAEs per model</em> (total 90), together with the runtime configuration. Times and sizes are approximate.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p5" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A1.SS2.p5.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A1.SS2.p5.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.SS2.p5.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.6pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A1.SS2.p5.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A1.SS2.p5.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.SS2.p5.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model</span></span>
</span></th>
<th id="A1.SS2.p5.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.6pt 4.0pt;">
