<span id="A6.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I2.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">17_162</span><span id="A6.I2.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: mathematical symbols and concepts related to coordinates, magnitudes, and parameters in equations</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;padding-top:2.0pt;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
