<span id="A6.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I2.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">17_2552</span><span id="A6.I2.i4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: dataset identifiers and technical terms common in research and academic documents</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I2.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;padding-top:2.0pt;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">5.</span> 
<span id="A6.I2.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A6.I2.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I2.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">17_16377</span><span id="A6.I2.i5.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: mathematical notation and technical terms commonly found in formal documents</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I2.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;padding-top:2.0pt;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">6.</span> 
