<span id="A6.I2.i9.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I2.i9.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">17_14657</span><span id="A6.I2.i9.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: mathematical notations and structures involving angle brackets and properties of functions</span></span>
